{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absorb the DNA of animals</strong> you found and <strong>gain its abilities</strong>, but only one at a time. To change forms, you\u2019ll have to die and respawn, turning each transformation into a deliberate puzzle choice.<br>This unique mechanic drives a puzzle-platforming adventure filled with handcrafted pixel-art environments and clever challenges built around the powers you absorb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use animal abilities to traverse obstacles, unlock new routes, and discover solutions that only specific forms can achieve. Every level is designed around experimentation, mastery, and thinking ahead about which ability you\u2019ll need next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DNA-based transformation system</strong> \u2013 Gain abilities instantly; switch only by dying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clever puzzle-platforming</strong> built around form-specific powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn pixel-art visuals</strong> with detailed animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creatures with unique abilities</strong> that shape how you move and solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focused, ability-driven level design</strong> encouraging experimentation and planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121290/extras/044f0ee73dd42de3a907f5eed677d32e.poster.avif?t=1766073155\" width=1170 height=58 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121290/extras/044f0ee73dd42de3a907f5eed677d32e.webm?t=1766073155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/im